lid.'=>'CSV náà kò tọ́.','Import complete - imported %s tax rates.'=>'Ìmport ti parí - %s ìwọn owó-ori ti wọlé.','All done!'=>'Gbogbo rẹ ti parí!','View tax rates'=>'Wo ìwọn owó-ori','Invalid file type. The importer supports CSV and TXT file formats.'=>'Iru fáìlì tí kò tọ́. Olùmport naa n ṣe atilẹyin awọn irú fáìlì CSV àti TXT.','Import tax rates'=>'Ìmport ìwọn owó-ori','Hi there! Upload a CSV file containing tax rates to import the contents into your settings. Choose a .csv file to upload, then click "Upload file and import".'=>'Báwo ni! Sọ́fí fáìlì CSV tí ó ní ìwọn owó-ori láti wọlé ak contenu rẹ sí àwọn eto rẹ. Yan fáìlì .csv kan láti sọ́fí, lẹ́yìn náà tẹ "Sọ́fí fáìlì àti wọlé".','Your CSV needs to include columns in a specific order. %1$sClick here to download a sample%2$s.'=>'CSV rẹ nilo láti ní àtẹ̀jáde ní àkópọ̀ kan. %1$sTẹ nibi láti gba àpẹẹrẹ%2$s.','Before you can upload your import file, you will need to fix the following error:'=>'Kí o tó lè sọ́fí fáìlì ìmport rẹ, o nilo láti túnṣe aṣiṣe tó tẹ̀síwájú:','Choose a file from your computer:'=>'Yan fáìlì kan láti inú kọ̀m̀pútà rẹ:','Maximum size: %s'=>'Iwọn tó pọ̀jù: %s','OR enter path to file:'=>'TABI tẹ ọna si faili:','Delimiter'=>'Aiyipada','Upload file and import'=>'Gbe faili soke ki o si gbe wọle','Sorry, there has been an error.'=>'E ma binu, aṣiṣe kan ti ṣẹlẹ.','And'=>'Ati','Or'=>'TABI','+ Add another condition'=>'+ Fi ipo miiran kun','First Name'=>'Oruko akọkọ','Phone Number'=>'Nọmba foonu','Town / City'=>'Ilu / Ẹkun','State / County'=>'Ipinle / Ijọba','Postcode / Zip'=>'Koodu ifiweranṣẹ / Zip','Size'=>'Iwọn','Large'=>'Nla','Medium'=>'Iwọn aarin','Media Library'=>'Ile-ikawe Media','Show Coupon Field?'=>'Fi aaye Coupon han?','Button Text'=>'Ọrọ Bọtini','Custom Tax Rates'=>'Iwọn Owo-ori Adani','Define country, state, postcode, and city-specific rates used during checkout.'=>'Ṣe alaye awọn orilẹ-ede, ipinlẹ, koodu ifiweranṣẹ, ati awọn oṣuwọn ti ilu-ni pato ti a lo nigba ti a n ra.','Search tax rates'=>'Wa awọn oṣuwọn owo-ori','Search rates...'=>'Wa awọn oṣuwọn...','Country code'=>'Koodu orilẹ-ede','State code'=>'Koodu ipinlẹ','Postcode'=>'Koodu ifiweranṣẹ','Rate %'=>'Oṣuwọn %','Tax Title'=>'Ak Title owo-ori','Priority'=>'Ipo','Insert row'=>'Fi ila kun','Remove selected row(s)'=>'Yọ ila ti a yan(k)','Save Tax Rates'=>'Fipamọ awọn oṣuwọn owo-ori','Import CSV'=>'Gbe CSV wọle','Export CSV'=>'Gbe CSV jade','Loading&hellip;'=>'Nṣiṣẹ&hellip;','Tax rate ID: %s'=>'ID oṣuwọn owo-ori: %s','No matching tax rates found.'=>'Ko si awọn oṣuwọn owo-ori ti o baamu ti a rii.','%s items'=>'%s awọn nkan','First page'=>'Oju-iwe akọkọ','Previous page'=>'Oju-iwe ti tẹlẹ','Current page'=>'Oju-iwe lọwọlọwọ','Next page'=>'Ibi oju-iwe to nbọ','Last page'=>'Ibi oju-iwe to kẹhin','Cart'=>'Káàtì','No payment methods found!'=>'Ko si awọn ọna isanwo ti a rii!','Please enable at least one payment method in the'=>'Jọwọ muu ṣiṣẹ o kere ju ọna isanwo kan ni','PublishPress Cart settings'=>'eto Káàtì PublishPress','Pages'=>'Oju-iwe','Branding'=>'Branding','Taxes'=>'Owo-ori','Invoices'=>'Ìwé-ìfowopamọ','Advanced'=>'Ipele','Currency and pricing defaults for your store.'=>'Iye owo ati awọn idiyele aiyipada fun ile itaja rẹ.','Choose the customer account page and policy links.'=>'Yan oju-iwe iroyin onibara ati awọn ọna asopọ ilanu.','Set the company details and logo used across customer documents.'=>'Ṣeto awọn alaye ile-iṣẹ ati aami ti a lo ni gbogbo awọn iwe onibara.','Choose which gateways accept payments and configure their keys.'=>'Yan awọn ẹnu-ọna wo ni o gba awọn isanwo ati tunto awọn bọtini wọn.','Configure tax rules and tax rates that apply at checkout.'=>'Tunto awọn ofin owo-ori ati awọn oṣuwọn owo-ori ti o wulo ni akoko isanwo.','Customize how invoices look and what details they include.'=>'Ṣe aṣa bi awọn ìwé-ìfowopamọ ṣe wo ati kini awọn alaye ti wọn ni.','Configure secure file download access and URL behavior.'=>'Tunto iraye si gbigba faili ti o ni aabo ati ihuwasi URL.','Tune sender details, test messages and customer notifications.'=>'Tunto awọn alaye oluranse, idanwo awọn ifiranṣẹ ati awọn akiyesi onibara.','Connect your store with marketing, analytics and automation tools.'=>'So ile itaja rẹ pọ pẹlu awọn irinṣẹ tita, itupalẹ ati adaṣiṣẹ.','Configure sales report recipients and email schedules.'=>'Ṣe atunṣe awọn olugba iroyin tita ati awọn eto imeeli.','Enable diagnostic logging and access debug log tools.'=>'Mu igbasilẹ iwadii ṣiṣẹ ati wọle si awọn irinṣẹ igbasilẹ aṣiṣe.','Configure store options that do not belong in the main setup tabs.'=>'Ṣe atunṣe awọn aṣayan ile itaja ti ko ni ibamu ninu awọn taabu eto akọkọ.','Configure plugin branding, menu labels and white-label documentation links.'=>'Ṣeto ami iyasọtọ plugin, awọn aami akojọ aṣayan ati awọn ọna asopọ iwe-aṣẹ funfun.','Store'=>'Ile itaja','Communication & Tools'=>'Ib Communication & Irinṣẹ','More'=>'Siwaju sii','ActiveCampaign'=>'ActiveCampaign','Sync customers and purchases to ActiveCampaign.'=>'Sopọ awọn alabara ati awọn rira si ActiveCampaign.','Mailchimp'=>'Mailchimp','Add customers to Mailchimp audiences and automate emails.'=>'Fi awọn alabara kun awọn olugbo Mailchimp ki o si ṣe awọn imeeli laifọwọyi.','Kit'=>'Kit','Send customers and purchases to Kit forms and tags.'=>'Ran awọn alabara ati awọn rira si awọn fọọmu ati awọn ami Kit.','MemberVault'=>'MemberVault','Protect content and manage members with MemberVault.'=>'Daabobo akoonu ati ṣakoso awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ pẹlu MemberVault.','SendFox'=>'SendFox','Grow your audience and send automated emails with SendFox.'=>'Gba awọn olugbo rẹ pọ si ki o si ran awọn imeeli laifọwọyi pẹlu SendFox.','Facebook Ad Events'=>'Iṣẹlẹ Ipolowo Facebook','Track purchase events and optimize your Facebook ads.'=>'Tẹle awọn iṣẹlẹ rira ki o si mu awọn ipolowo Facebook rẹ dara si.','Google Analytics'=>'Google Analytics','Track purchase events in Google Analytics.'=>'Tẹle awọn iṣẹlẹ rira ni Google Analytics.','Google reCAPTCHA'=>'Google reCAPTCHA','Protect checkout forms from spam and bot submissions.'=>'Daabobo fọọmu ìdíyelé lati spam ati ìròyìn bot.','Google reCAPTCHA v2'=>'Google reCAPTCHA v2','Configure checkbox or invisible reCAPTCHA v2 protection.'=>'Ṣeto apoti ayẹwo tabi aabo reCAPTCHA v2 ti ko han.','Google reCAPTCHA v3'=>'Google reCAPTCHA v3','Configure score-based reCAPTCHA v3 protection.'=>'Ṣeto aabo reCAPTCHA v3 ti o da lori awọn akọsilẹ.','Drip'=>'Drip','Sync customers, tags and ecommerce activity to Drip.'=>'Sopọ awọn onibara, awọn aami ati iṣẹ ecommerce si Drip.','MailerLite'=>'MailerLite','Add customers to MailerLite subscribers and groups.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun si awọn alabapin ati awọn ẹgbẹ MailerLite.','MailPoet'=>'MailPoet','Add customers to MailPoet lists.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun si awọn atokọ MailPoet.','Encharge'=>'Encharge','Track order events and sync customers to Encharge.'=>'Tẹle awọn iṣẹlẹ aṣẹ ati sopọ awọn onibara si Encharge.','FluentCRM'=>'FluentCRM','Add customers to FluentCRM lists and tags.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun si awọn atokọ ati awọn aami FluentCRM.','Academy LMS'=>'Academy LMS','Enroll or remove students from Academy LMS courses.'=>'Forukọsilẹ tabi yọ awọn ọmọ ile-iwe kuro ninu awọn ẹkọ Academy LMS.','Gurucan'=>'Gurucan','Add or remove customers in Gurucan products.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun tabi yọ wọn ni awọn ọja Gurucan.','Heartbeat'=>'Ibi-ibè','Manage community access in Heartbeat.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si agbegbe ni Ibi-ibè.','Kajabi'=>'Kajabi','Enable Kajabi purchase automations.'=>'Mu awọn adaṣe rira Kajabi ṣiṣẹ.','Teachable'=>'Teachable','Enroll customers into Teachable schools and products.'=>'Forukọsilẹ awọn onibara sinu awọn ile-iwe ati awọn ọja Teachable.','Upcoach'=>'Upcoach','Grant customers access to Upcoach programs.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si awọn eto Upcoach.','Tutor LMS'=>'Tutor LMS','Enroll or remove students from Tutor LMS courses.'=>'Forukọsilẹ tabi yọ awọn ọmọ ile-iwe kuro ninu awọn kọsitọmu Tutor LMS.','LearnDash'=>'LearnDash','Grant or revoke LearnDash course access.'=>'Fun tab